{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e14-scene-03",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "恋爱改变了一个人  (How Falling in Love Changed the Boss)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Once Chun Yuqiao escorts Xin Huimei to the dressing room, Kaiwen, Xingzi, and Bu Xiaogu gather on the studio floor in disbelief at how gentle their boss has become. Listen to their conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "所有人准备，一会儿就开始干活了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "不靠谱这三个字，跟他永远都沾不上边，好不好？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我心里听着也怪别扭的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "原来爱上一个人，会变成这个样子。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "他彻底都改变了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "辛惠美就是这种可以让男人为她着迷的女人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "闻思默是这样，没想到连老大也这样。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，你还是挺幸运的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "最起码闻思默老师他还是单身啊，对吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "小谷，他在向你招手。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "所有人准备，一会儿就开始干活了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everyone get ready—we start working in just a moment.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "不靠谱这三个字，跟他永远都沾不上边，好不好？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The word unreliable has never had anything to do with him in his entire life, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我心里听着也怪别扭的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hearing him say that felt mighty strange to me too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "原来爱上一个人，会变成这个样子。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So falling in love with someone can change a person like this.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "他彻底都改变了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He has changed completely from head to toe.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "辛惠美就是这种可以让男人为她着迷的女人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xin Huimei is the kind of woman who can make any man fall under her spell.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "闻思默是这样，没想到连老大也这样。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wen Simo was like that, and who knew even our boss would be too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，你还是挺幸运的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sister Xingzi, you are still pretty fortunate.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "最起码闻思默老师他还是单身啊，对吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'At the very least, Mr Wen Simo is still single, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "小谷，他在向你招手。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, the boss is waving for you to come over.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "所有人准备，一会儿就开始干活了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "不靠谱这三个字，跟他永远都沾不上边，好不好？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我心里听着也怪别扭的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "原来爱上一个人，会变成这个样子。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "他彻底都改变了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "辛惠美就是这种可以让男人为她着迷的女人。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "闻思默是这样，没想到连老大也这样。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，你还是挺幸运的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "最起码闻思默老师他还是单身啊，对吧？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "小谷，他在向你招手。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Putting romance chatter aside, Bu Xiaogu hurries over to answer Chun Yuqiao's summons. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
